00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Your everyday Mac actions, made clearer.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Press Control-Option-P. A plain panel appears. TextEdit stays as it is.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,500
Click Save. TextEdit saves your document.

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Your typing stays in your document.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,500
Find, in one clear click.

6
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:37,500
Only actions we have tested: Safari Reload and New Tab.

7
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,040
Apps we have not tested get an honest message.

8
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:44,040
Press Control-Option-P again to close it.

9
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:49,040
PlainClick. Clear controls. Less clutter. Join the beta.

